0,"text":"Thanks for watching.","kw":["thanks","watching"],"ch":6},{"t":23.35,"dur":8.8,"clip":"06_public-grid/Person's_face_reflecting_television_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Person's_face_reflecting_television_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was an illusion, a vast artificial dream projected directly into our minds.","kw":["illusion","vast","artificial","dream","projected","directly","minds"],"ch":6},{"t":34.31,"dur":7,"clip":"06_public-grid/Computer_terminals_in_municipal_…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Computer_terminals_in_municipal_…_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1972, a new experiment began to connect ordinary people to a vast network of data.","kw":["experiment","began","connect","ordinary","people","vast","network","data"],"ch":6},{"t":43.93,"dur":9,"clip":"06_public-grid/Control-room_diagram_shows_hiera…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Control-room_diagram_shows_hiera…_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1972, a new idea emerged, to manage the city as a pure system of data.","kw":["idea","emerged","manage","city","pure","system","data"],"ch":6},{"t":60.29,"dur":5.68,"clip":"06_public-grid/Urban_cybernetics_proposal_diagram_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Urban_cybernetics_proposal_diagram_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1970s, a new idea took hold, to manage the city as a pure data system.","kw":["idea","took","hold","manage","city","pure","data","system"],"ch":6},{"t":70.45,"dur":4,"clip":"06_public-grid/People_gathered_media_center_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/People_gathered_media_center_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1972, a new idealism took hold.","kw":["idealism","took","hold"],"ch":6},{"t":77.65,"dur":8,"clip":"06_public-grid/Hands_passing_video_tape_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Hands_passing_video_tape_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the era when we believed that capturing reality on tape would somehow set us free.","kw":["when","believed","capturing","reality","tape","would","somehow","free"],"ch":6},{"t":88.75,"dur":5,"clip":"06_public-grid/AI_historical_reconstruction_chi…_202607101856.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/AI_historical_reconstruction_chi…_202607101856.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a moment when we believed technology would mirror our best selves.","kw":["moment","when","believed","technology","would","mirror","best","selves"],"ch":6},{"t":95.57,"dur":3,"clip":"06_public-grid/Person_talking_to_studio_camera_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Person_talking_to_studio_camera_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment when the old illusions began to collapse.","kw":["moment","when","illusions","began","collapse"],"ch":6},{"t":101.17,"dur":3,"clip":"06_public-grid/Person_talking_to_studio_camera_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Person_talking_to_studio_camera_202607101928.mp4","in":6.68,"text":"human nature, and that was when the real chaos began.","kw":["human","nature","when","real","chaos","began"],"ch":6},{"t":106.57,"dur":5.52,"clip":"06_public-grid/Communal_projection_event_in_park_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Communal_projection_event_in_park_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"A new kind of collective experience began to emerge.","kw":["kind","collective","experience","began","emerge"],"ch":6},{"t":114.51,"dur":5,"clip":"06_public-grid/Community_members_operate_video_…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Community_members_operate_video_…_202607101928.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They believed they could use tape to create a new kind of society.","kw":["believed","could","tape","create","kind","society"],"ch":6},{"t":122.65,"dur":4,"clip":"06_public-grid/Geodesic_dome_structure_suburban…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Geodesic_dome_structure_suburban…_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1972, we believed we could design a new way of living.","kw":["believed","could","design","living"],"ch":6},{"t":127.74,"dur":3,"clip":"06_public-grid/Geodesic_dome_at_dusk_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Geodesic_dome_at_dusk_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1972 we believed.","kw":["believed"],"ch":6},{"t":132.85,"dur":2,"clip":"06_public-grid/Geodesic_dome_at_dusk_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Geodesic_dome_at_dusk_202607101928.mp4","in":6.88,"text":"outside the old structures of power.","kw":["outside","structures","power"],"ch":6}],"duck":[[0,10.01,0.55],[10.26,20.49,0.28],[23.35,32.4,0.28],[34.31,41.56,0.28],[43.93,53.18,0.28],[60.29,66.22,0.28],[70.45,74.7,0.28],[77.65,85.9,0.28],[88.75,94,0.28],[95.57,98.82,0.28],[101.17,104.42,0.28],[106.57,112.34,0.28],[114.51,119.76,0.28],[122.65,126.9,0.28],[127.74,130.99,0.28],[132.85,135.1,0.28]],"coverage":0.698,"used":30,"pool":43,"speech":0.608,"eras":[6],"filmName":"SWEEP 6 FILM ch6"}